{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54068","headline":"答王侍郎讽问黑豆未生芽时颂（题拟） · 义忠","name":"答王侍郎讽问黑豆未生芽时颂（题拟）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"菩提慧日朝朝照，般若凉风夜夜吹。\n此处不生聚杂树，满山明月是禅枝。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"义忠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54068.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54068","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言绝句","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}